&lt;p&gt;Below are CPT&lt;sup&gt;&amp;#174;&lt;&sol;sup&gt;&sol;HCPCS codes related to SRT.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;&sol;strong&gt;Providers are reminded to refer to the long descriptors of the CPT&lt;sup&gt;&amp;#174;&lt;&sol;sup&gt; codes in their CPT&lt;sup&gt;&amp;#174;&lt;&sol;sup&gt; books&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background: yellow;&quot;&gt; &lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Per CPT 2026 guidance, SRT should not be reported in conjunction with megavoltage (MeV) (77402, 77407, 77412). &lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To bill electronic brachytherapy treatment delivery use CPT code 77437 (e.g., electronic brachytherapy). When billing 77437 for SRT treatment delivery services covered by the LCD providers must append the KX modifier. &lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For SRT treatment planning and simulation aided field setting use CPT code 77436. &lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CPT 77436 is not typically repeated with each treatment except when clinically indicated and documentation supports additional simulation requirements. Do not report clinical treatment planning (77261, 77262, 77263), simulation (77280, 77285, 77290, 77295), basic dosimetry calculation (77300), special dosimetry (77331), treatment devices (77332, 77333, 77334), isodose planning (77306, 77307, 77316, 77317, 77318), or radiation treatment management (77427, 77431, 77432, 77435, 77469, 77470, 77499) in conjunction with 77436 and 77437.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Code 77336 can only be billed when medically necessary for treatment adjustments in support of the radiation oncologist or other health care qualified professional.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Code 77370 is to be used when the complexity of the treatment plan is great. It is not expected that code 77370 will be reported for SRT services.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use of 77370 with SRT code 77437 may lead to medical review.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The following CPT codes are considered not medically reasonable and necessary (non-covered).&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Electronic brachytherapy is non-covered and must be billed without a KX modifier.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anterior and&sol;or Posterior Cervical Fusions&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note: &lt;&sol;strong&gt;Providers are reminded to refer to the long descriptors of the CPT codes in their CPT book.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following &lt;strong&gt;Anterior and&sol;or Posterior Cervical Fusions&lt;&sol;strong&gt; CPT codes will not be subject to the ICD-10-CM diagnosis code restrictions in the article: &lt;strong&gt;22800, 22802, 22808, 22810, and 22812.&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anterior and&sol;or Posterior Cervical Fusions&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note: &lt;&sol;strong&gt;Providers are reminded to refer to the long descriptors of the CPT codes in their CPT book.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following &lt;strong&gt;Anterior and&sol;or Posterior Spinal Deformity Fusion&lt;&sol;strong&gt; CPT codes will not be subject to the ICD-10-CM diagnosis code restrictions in the article: &lt;strong&gt;22800, 22802, 22808, 22810, and 22812.&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;For CPT&lt;sup&gt;&amp;#174;&lt;&sol;sup&gt; 64561, no separate code may be added for fluoroscopic imaging, as this is included in the code.&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt; &lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;For CPT&lt;sup&gt;&amp;#174;&lt;&sol;sup&gt; 64581, imaging guidance is not included, so it can be separately coded.&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

